## 🏗️ Architecture Overview

```
lib/
├── core/                          # Cross-cutting concerns
│   ├── constants/                 # ✅ PRIMARY theme files
│   │   ├── app_theme.dart         # Main theme (Google Fonts)
│   │   ├── app_colors.dart        # Color definitions
│   │   └── app_design_tokens.dart # Spacing, sizing tokens
│   ├── services/                  # App-wide services
│   │   ├── feedback_service.dart  # ✅ SnackBar/Toast handling
│   │   ├── notification_service.dart
│   │   ├── backup_service.dart
│   │   └── ...
│   ├── router/                    # Navigation (GoRouter)
│   └── utils/                     # Helper functions
├── shared/
│   └── widgets/
│       ├── states/                # ⚠️ State widgets HERE!
│       │   ├── empty_state_widget.dart
│       │   ├── loading_widget.dart
│       │   ├── error_widget.dart
│       │   ├── skeleton_widgets.dart  # ✅ Shimmer skeletons
│       │   └── states.dart        # Barrel file
│       ├── animations/
│       ├── buttons/
│       ├── fields/
│       ├── forms/
│       └── layout/
└── features/
    ├── dashboard/
    ├── finance/
    ├── health/
    ├── notes/
    ├── reminders/
    └── settings/
```

